{"type":"assistant","uuid":"b4430a77-741a-461b-9f1c-725c66b71f21","session_id":"b8699ab0-01de-4568-96a8-16d7259edfdf","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"b4430a77-741a-461b-9f1c-725c66b71f21","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThe patch has been created successfully at `bug-159-fix.patch`. Here's a summary of the fix:\n\n## Bug Fix Summary\n\n**Bug:** Crash when changing card type for multiple selected cards in Card Browser's multi-select mode. Only the first card was affected.\n\n**Root Cause:** Two issues in the codebase:\n\n1. **CardBrowser.java** (`openNoteEditorForCurrentlySelectedNote()`): When the user selected multiple cards and clicked \"Edit\", this method only opened the NoteEditor for the **first** selected card (using `getSelectedCardIds()[0]`), discarding the rest of the selection.\n\n2. **NoteEditor.java** (`changeNoteType()`): This method always changed the note type for only the single note being edited (`mEditorNote.getId()`), ignoring any other selected cards.\n\n**Fix:**\n\n1. **CardBrowser.java** — Rewrote `openNoteEditorForCurrentlySelectedNote()` to:\n   - Collect unique note IDs from **all** selected cards\n   - Pass all note IDs via a new intent extra (`EXTRA_NOTE_IDS`)\n   - Still open the editor for the first card (for preview), but now with knowledge of all notes to change\n\n2. **NoteEditor.java** — Three changes:\n   - Added `EXTRA_NOTE_IDS` intent extra constant\n   - Added `mAllNoteIds` field to store the passed note IDs  \n   - Read `EXTRA_NOTE_IDS` from intent in `CALLER_CARDBROWSER_EDIT` case\n   - Modified `changeNoteType()` to use all provided note IDs when available, falling back to single-note behavior for non-multi-select cases\n\n**Note:** The project build requires network access to download Android Gradle plugin dependencies, which is unavailable in this environment. The code changes are syntactically correct and follow existing project conventions."}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":82853,"output_tokens":412,"cache_read_input_tokens":79648,"total_tokens":83265}}}
