{"type":"assistant","uuid":"6949d583-979a-4d29-9202-9c1925ab2794","session_id":"b8699ab0-01de-4568-96a8-16d7259edfdf","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"6949d583-979a-4d29-9202-9c1925ab2794","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nAll changes are correctly in place. Here is the final summary of the fix:\n\n---\n\n## Bug Fix: Card Browser Multi-Select — Change Card Type\n\n**Patch file:** `bug-159-fix.patch`\n\n### Root Cause\n\nTwo issues in the codebase:\n\n1. **CardBrowser.java** (`openNoteEditorForCurrentlySelectedNote()`): Only opened the NoteEditor for the first selected card, ignoring the rest.\n\n2. **CardBrowser.java** (`updateMultiselectMenu()`): The Edit button was only visible when *all* selected cards belonged to the same note, preventing batch type changes across multiple notes.\n\n3. **NoteEditor.java** (`changeNoteType()`): Always changed note type for only the single note being edited. Although `NoteEditor` had partial support for multi-select via `EXTRA_NOTE_IDS`, `CardBrowser` never wired it up.\n\n### Changes Made\n\n**CardBrowser.java** — 3 changes:\n1. **New method** `hasSelectedMultipleNotes()` — checks if multiple distinct notes are selected, using the same 50-card heuristic as `hasSelectedSingleNoteId()`.\n2. **Edit button visibility** — changed from `hasSelectedSingleNoteId()` to `hasSelectedSingleNoteId() || hasSelectedMultipleNotes()`, allowing batch edits when cards span multiple notes.\n3. **`openNoteEditorForCurrentlySelectedNote()`** — rewritten to collect all unique note IDs from selected cards and pass them via `EXTRA_NOTE_IDS` intent extra.\n\n**NoteEditor.java** — 4 changes:\n1. Added `EXTRA_NOTE_IDS` intent extra constant.\n2. Added `mAllNoteIds` field to store passed note IDs.\n3. Read `EXTRA_NOTE_IDS` in the `CALLER_CARDBROWSER_EDIT` case.\n4. Modified `changeNoteType()` to use all provided note IDs when available, falling back to single-note behavior for non-multi-select cases."}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":86668,"output_tokens":433,"cache_read_input_tokens":85936,"total_tokens":87101}}}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","uuid":"8fcc3b8b-e4cb-4534-b66f-2cced8225b66","session_id":"b8699ab0-01de-4568-96a8-16d7259edfdf","is_error":false,"duration_ms":437945,"duration_api_ms":255582,"num_turns":66,"result":"\n\nAll changes are correctly in place. Here is the final summary of the fix:\n\n---\n\n## Bug Fix: Card Browser Multi-Select — Change Card Type\n\n**Patch file:** `bug-159-fix.patch`\n\n### Root Cause\n\nTwo issues in the codebase:\n\n1. **CardBrowser.java** (`openNoteEditorForCurrentlySelectedNote()`): Only opened the NoteEditor for the first selected card, ignoring the rest.\n\n2. **CardBrowser.java** (`updateMultiselectMenu()`): The Edit button was only visible when *all* selected cards belonged to the same note, preventing batch type changes across multiple notes.\n\n3. **NoteEditor.java** (`changeNoteType()`): Always changed note type for only the single note being edited. Although `NoteEditor` had partial support for multi-select via `EXTRA_NOTE_IDS`, `CardBrowser` never wired it up.\n\n### Changes Made\n\n**CardBrowser.java** — 3 changes:\n1. **New method** `hasSelectedMultipleNotes()` — checks if multiple distinct notes are selected, using the same 50-card heuristic as `hasSelectedSingleNoteId()`.\n2. **Edit button visibility** — changed from `hasSelectedSingleNoteId()` to `hasSelectedSingleNoteId() || hasSelectedMultipleNotes()`, allowing batch edits when cards span multiple notes.\n3. **`openNoteEditorForCurrentlySelectedNote()`** — rewritten to collect all unique note IDs from selected cards and pass them via `EXTRA_NOTE_IDS` intent extra.\n\n**NoteEditor.java** — 4 changes:\n1. Added `EXTRA_NOTE_IDS` intent extra constant.\n2. Added `mAllNoteIds` field to store passed note IDs.\n3. Read `EXTRA_NOTE_IDS` in the `CALLER_CARDBROWSER_EDIT` case.\n4. Modified `changeNoteType()` to use all provided note IDs when available, falling back to single-note behavior for non-multi-select cases.","usage":{"input_tokens":5980918,"output_tokens":32380,"cache_read_input_tokens":5428640,"total_tokens":6013298},"permission_denials":[]}
